      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I absolutely completely and unequivocally support this. It would make the game so, so much better if adult groups and their group instances could be completely blocked off from accounts marked as under 18.\n\nEven if you don't run suggestive or adult themed groups, some groups want to rightfully remain 18+; for example, the two improv groups I am part of are 18+ since they don't want to have children in their improv scenes or shows (anything can happen in improv).\n\nIt would be a BOON for them to be able to easily gate access from children, and for group events to remain non-children for the safety and peace of mind of everyone involved.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
